---
description: Rules for pi-js, the QuickJS runtime with Node 22 built-in modules that runs pi extensions
globs: crates/pi-js/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow @crates/pi-js/AGENTS.md and @docs/agents/node-compat.md.

- Match Node 22 return values, error codes, messages, and event order. Get expected output from real Node 22.
- Update `crates/pi-js/src/unsupported.rs` in the same change that closes or leaves a gap.
- Tests use localhost and temp dirs, and `run_cjs_within` for scripts that can hang.
- `cfg(windows)` code must cross-build with `cargo zigbuild --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu -p pi-js --tests`.
